              <l xml:id="m-f3a56180-317d-4cb0-93a2-3acc70faa4ed" facs="#m-28288431-1446-4e8e-acfb-d607b6d556d4" label="ambiguous">February 3. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-5c584294-b983-400f-9572-144aaa438359" facs="#m-45555941-eaaf-486b-bd11-59d885c0b9c0" label="ambiguous">1307</l><l xml:id="m-6a589c82-e29a-4dac-afde-3011dd04268c" facs="#m-556000bb-4482-4e92-98f7-8c4dbf57208a" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f9283706-d98e-41d2-8c60-f0d01673568d" facs="#m-73e6c6ab-a992-4cc6-a704-9d2efb4e4b77" label="ambiguous">Mal.3.</l><l xml:id="m-9e519ae4-cc73-439c-9bdf-d086d7d26251" facs="#m-3bef15be-c0fb-400e-b69c-504ae9ed1a57" label="lyrics-like">"Cce ego mitto Angelum meum, templum sanctum suum Dominá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4532c38b-4cb5-4547-a547-7727cb1dc1ea" facs="#m-c4e63174-08ad-44b2-bb46-c6c9c6e34bbd" label="lyrics-like">Cet praeparábit viam ante fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f820d59-db57-47a4-b70d-40e4c88ca521" facs="#m-16d45b49-832d-41c6-aa63-7e3ea8043823" label="lyrics-like">tor, quem vos quaéritis, * et Ange¬</l><l xml:id="m-e64e46b2-815f-45ab-b791-5ba99c74cc9a" facs="#m-00422745-afba-4d98-acd3-9ef73918960e" label="lyrics-like">ciem meam. f Et statim véniet ad lus testaménti, quem vos vultis.</l><l xml:id="m-bbd1788f-f21a-4eab-ae4d-1ca36ffd7ad9" facs="#m-6de8f87f-da52-4e34-b90a-e61c7c6065f7" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Ave máris stélla. p. 1259.</l><l xml:id="m-6eb3a351-c97b-4ddd-92dd-622f8c1d4314" facs="#m-5b30bbff-891e-40af-8b64-f3cf74a905c6" label="lyrics-like">V. Respónsum accépit Símeon a Spíritu Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-721d06c0-28d7-4a25-936c-f79baed9a0bd" facs="#m-b543d90a-1d07-4b56-86a5-97ff82bdabd2" label="lyrics-like">R. Non visúrum se mórtem, nisi vidéret Christum Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-776ff11e-1ad6-4eb2-826e-057f7167e130" facs="#m-d973a1a0-1439-4d79-a581-1ec80884a5f2" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-5a351dfa-3e6b-4c04-aaa1-9e24e6ed5010" facs="#m-a6c62a9e-1dc7-4c4e-892b-7ca3dc636e32" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G*</l><l xml:id="m-5352c97c-1256-4187-a25c-cd567b3c7974" facs="#m-87523d16-8b79-4a35-aa5e-33267f69df0e" label="lyrics-like">N Odi-e "be-á-ta Virgo Ma-rí¬a</l><l xml:id="m-60036dc3-eef4-4591-a936-8b8e61aa02db" facs="#m-01e01686-0c0d-42e3-8b17-6bdff84b5861" label="lyrics-like">pú-erum</l><l xml:id="m-df488213-b3ca-46ac-a155-7f79d49cd924" facs="#m-9c3e9093-628b-4f5f-a794-0a1f9619bd28" label="lyrics-like">Jésum praesentá-vit in témplo: et Sime-on, replé-tus</l><l xml:id="m-ed2fed72-e4e6-4916-826f-707316381015" facs="#m-4f5d4eb8-c068-414e-af19-f87f5731e954" label="lyrics-like">accé- pit é-um in úlnas sú-as,</l><l xml:id="m-3437cc69-623e-438c-9baf-a92862382642" facs="#m-4633b516-d34c-4883-b2c3-8b5668947740" label="lyrics-like">Spí-ri-tu Sáncto,</l><l xml:id="m-e1bf56b6-3cec-4cf3-bf86-c6df1b47fe6e" facs="#m-456ca156-16d1-4c8f-a88d-a8253ba1ea2b" label="lyrics-like">et benedí-xit Dé¬ um in aetérnum. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-e761a49b-4232-416d-9d52-5a7b5b45ebf1" facs="#m-6319c773-4cf4-4a6c-8538-f6557afbf1a0" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. Gx. p. 212 or p. 218.— Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 1362</l><l xml:id="m-35c31838-e457-4d66-8ab9-fc111f39938d" facs="#m-0119ab68-9f9b-4b55-8359-42bc5610e18c" label="text-like">St. Blaise, Bishop and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-13b61958-15ed-4560-ab7c-9e73e38883ff" facs="#m-f28dada5-be3d-4573-a5d9-3d868654d902" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-5dbbcbc2-b4d3-417c-97c0-6e85ba22d6d5" facs="#m-2e3bf0b4-42bf-41c8-92b8-7c939c35d338" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Sacerdótes Déi. 1132.</l><l xml:id="m-56a4d9c8-e121-4de5-9ec2-5184ad07d391" facs="#m-47169bc9-5b4a-4263-a21e-c4bded9a1be8" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3a3b6b5e-b478-48c5-b336-eba888539722" facs="#m-504ff999-763f-41c8-970f-a3b7621b932b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos beáti Blásii Márty-] propitius; ut cujus natalitia cóli¬</l><l xml:id="m-87c34221-39ab-4f07-9bc9-872463ad30f8" facs="#m-bf41eefb-63ae-473a-a982-cfe7d7a267ed" label="lyrics-like">U ris tui atque Pontificis ánnua) mus“ de ejúsdem étiam protectió</l><l xml:id="m-7c9251ec-9e9d-41e5-8f10-36fd36958253" facs="#m-4d7d1cfc-4ecb-4136-9bb6-e254ce7ef046" label="lyrics-like">solemnitáte laetfficas: t concéde! ne gaudeámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-575aaf37-13a6-4ebe-9076-a5190ded3bb5" facs="#m-111b4213-b295-49b3-b59b-3ceeb7071921" label="text-like">4. St. Andrew Corsini, Bishop and Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-c9770e16-166a-4d24-b7d3-414530022d3a" facs="#m-953fc5a2-277c-4ce9-b3f4-2b4228a5a804" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-e438f093-fce6-4724-a060-6167f159bbcd" facs="#m-5d80345e-ebb0-4bf4-ada7-dbe566a0597a" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Státuit. of a Confessor Bishop, p. 1182.</l><l xml:id="m-be07a8fd-b7a1-4aa8-bbdb-eea4cbd4f91b" facs="#m-f6515efc-1cfe-4384-ad20-d19d8eee46ab" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-42bf7148-1575-472f-a284-c6cf94a978fd" facs="#m-0e85518c-9618-472f-94bb-5ff81fc8f84c" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui in Ecclésia tua noval dréae Confessóris tui atque Ponti¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4add116-e678-46aa-81d0-3e6157f19c13" facs="#m-4a528dd5-4c78-4c69-8e3b-20b92d246d5a" label="lyrics-like">I semper instáuras exémpla vir- ficis ita sequi vestigia, * ut assequá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9cae160c-b851-4c55-845c-b2a2c53a4ba6" facs="#m-5461f656-1cf4-4f4b-88c8-983afeea2922" label="lyrics-like">tútum: t da pópulo tuo beáti An-l tur et praémia. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
